  "description": "Convert HTML and Markdown to DOCX and PDF; render DOCX, XLSX and PPTX to PDF; export DOCX to\n      HTML/Markdown and XLSX to CSV/HTML; read text out of a PDF; and create/edit DOCX, XLSX and\n      PPTX - pure managed, no native binaries, no browser, no LibreOffice, no Office interop. Runs\n      on Linux, Windows and macOS, and makes no network calls at runtime.",
